NOTE ON THE ADJACENT SOURCES

The indicator properties implemented here originate in:

  Butlin, P., Long, R., Elmoznino, E., Bengio, Y., Birch, J., Constant, A.,
  Deane, G., Fleming, S. M., Frith, C., Ji, X., Kanai, R., Klein, C.,
  Lindsay, G., Michel, M., Mudrik, L., Peters, M. A. K., Schwitzgebel, E.,
  Simon, J., & VanRullen, R. (2023). Consciousness in Artificial Intelligence:
  Insights from the Science of Consciousness. arXiv:2308.08708.
  (CC BY-NC-SA 4.0)

  Butlin, P., Long, R., Bayne, T., Bengio, Y., et al. (2026). Identifying
  indicators of consciousness in AI systems. Trends in Cognitive Sciences,
  30(6), 488-501. https://doi.org/10.1016/j.tics.2025.10.011

This repository contains an INDEPENDENT IMPLEMENTATION of a scoring approach
over those indicator properties, plus original calibration and robustness work.
It is not affiliated with or endorsed by the original authors. No claim is made
that the original authors endorse this aggregation method or its results.